/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (It parses C code, applying abstractions from a .prx test harness to focus on key behaviors. Abstractions simplify details \(e.g., variables to booleans\) to prevent state-space explosion. The .prx file specifies functions, abstraction rules, and environment \(e.g., stubbed inputs\), creating a compact Promela model for SPIN verification. )
/E (It parses C code, applying abstractions from a .prx test harness to focus on key behaviors. Abstractions simplify details \(e.g., variables to booleans\) to prevent state-space explosion. The .prx file specifies functions, abstraction rules, and environment \(e.g., stubbed inputs\), creating a compact Promela model for SPIN verification. )
/Pg 86 0 R
/K [3]
>>
